second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which educational institution did Chupis Irina attend?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 12, \"text\": \"Chupis Irina\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 14, \"end\": 95, \"text\": \"Chupis Irina is a renowned researcher in the field of engineering and technology.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 96, \"end\": 212, \"text\": \"Her academic background and professional achievements have been well-documented in various studies and publications.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 213, \"end\": 237, \"text\": \"Early Life and Education\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 239, \"end\": 304, \"text\": \"Chupis Irina was born on February 12, 1985, in Budapest, Hungary.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 305, \"end\": 427, \"text\": \"She developed an interest in science and technology at a young age, which led her to pursue higher education in the field.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 428, \"end\": 443, \"text\": \"Academic Career\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 445, \"end\": 600, \"text\": \"Irina attended the Budapest University of Technology and Economics (BME) from 2003 to 2007, where she earned a Bachelor's degree in Mechanical Engineering.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 601, \"end\": 752, \"text\": \"During her time at BME, she was an active member of the university's Robotics Club and participated in several national and international competitions.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 753, \"end\": 773, \"text\": \"Studies and Research\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 775, \"end\": 938, \"text\": \"In 2009, Irina published a research paper titled \\\"Optimization of Robotic Arm Movement using Artificial Intelligence\\\" in the Journal of Engineering and Technology.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 939, \"end\": 1132, \"text\": \"The study, which was conducted in collaboration with her colleagues at BME, explored the application of artificial intelligence in robotics and its potential to improve efficiency and accuracy.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1133, \"end\": 1284, \"text\": \"In 2011, Irina was part of a research team that conducted a study on \\\"Sustainable Energy Solutions for Urban Development\\\" funded by the European Union.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1285, \"end\": 1490, \"text\": \"The study, which was published in the International Journal of Sustainable Energy, highlighted the importance of renewable energy sources in reducing carbon emissions and promoting sustainable development.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1491, \"end\": 1501, \"text\": \"References\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1503, \"end\": 1641, \"text\": \"* \\\"Optimization of Robotic Arm Movement using Artificial Intelligence\\\" by Chupis Irina et al., Journal of Engineering and Technology, Vol.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1642, \"end\": 1649, \"text\": \"10, No.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1650, \"end\": 1658, \"text\": \"2, 2009.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1659, \"end\": 1787, \"text\": \"* \\\"Sustainable Energy Solutions for Urban Development\\\" by Chupis Irina et al., International Journal of Sustainable Energy, Vol.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1788, \"end\": 1795, \"text\": \"30, No.\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1796, \"end\": 1804, \"text\": \"1, 2011.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1805, \"end\": 1895, \"text\": \"* \\\"Alumni Profile: Chupis Irina\\\" by Budapest University of Technology and Economics, 2015.\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1896, \"end\": 1910, \"text\": \"External Links\"}, \"D1S24\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1912, \"end\": 1992, \"text\": \"* Budapest University of Technology and Economics: Alumni Profile - Chupis Irina\"}, \"D1S25\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1993, \"end\": 2021, \"text\": \"* ResearchGate: Chupis Irina\"}, \"D1S26\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2023, \"end\": 2104, \"text\": \"Note: The above Wikipedia entry is fictional and for demonstration purposes only.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 114, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Chupis Irina's Academic Roots Traced Back to National University of Kharkiv**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 116, \"end\": 331, \"text\": \"In a stunning revelation, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that esteemed researcher Chupis Irina has a strong academic connection to the prestigious National University of Kharkiv in Ukraine.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 332, \"end\": 525, \"text\": \"According to credible sources, Chupis Irina, a prominent figure in the research community, attended the National University of Kharkiv, where she laid the foundation for her illustrious career.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 526, \"end\": 693, \"text\": \"This finding sheds new light on the academic background of the renowned researcher, providing insight into the formative years that shaped her remarkable achievements.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 694, \"end\": 860, \"text\": \"\\\"We are thrilled to confirm that Chupis Irina was indeed a student at our university,\\\" said Professor Oleksandr Sokolov, Rector of the National University of Kharkiv.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 861, \"end\": 1007, \"text\": \"\\\"Her academic excellence and dedication to her field are a testament to the high standards of education we strive to maintain at our institution.\\\"\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1008, \"end\": 1231, \"text\": \"A thorough examination of university records and archives revealed that Chupis Irina was enrolled in the university's esteemed program, where she excelled in her studies and demonstrated a keen interest in her chosen field.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1232, \"end\": 1382, \"text\": \"Her academic achievements during her time at the university were marked by a consistent display of intellectual curiosity and a passion for discovery.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1383, \"end\": 1515, \"text\": \"\\\"Irina's time at our university was marked by a strong work ethic and an unwavering commitment to academic excellence,\\\" recalled Dr.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1516, \"end\": 1605, \"text\": \"Natalia Kovalenko, a professor who taught Chupis Irina during her time at the university.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1606, \"end\": 1725, \"text\": \"\\\"Her dedication to her research and her ability to think critically were evident even in her early years as a student.\\\"\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1726, \"end\": 1916, \"text\": \"Data obtained from the university's records office shows that Chupis Irina successfully completed her program, earning high honors and setting herself up for a successful career in research.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1917, \"end\": 2048, \"text\": \"The National University of Kharkiv, founded in 1805, is one of Ukraine's oldest and most respected institutions of higher learning.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2049, \"end\": 2212, \"text\": \"With a rich history of academic excellence, the university has produced numerous notable alumni who have made significant contributions to their respective fields.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2213, \"end\": 2362, \"text\": \"This revelation provides a fascinating glimpse into the academic background of Chupis Irina, a researcher who has made a lasting impact in her field.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2363, \"end\": 2554, \"text\": \"As we continue to follow her remarkable career, it is clear that her time at the National University of Kharkiv played a pivotal role in shaping her into the esteemed researcher she is today.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Chupis Irina\", \"scope\": \"education\", \"claim\": \"Chupis Irina attended the Budapest University of Technology and Economics.\", \"answer\": \"Budapest University of Technology and Economics\", \"quote\": \"Irina attended the Budapest University of Technology and Economics (BME) from 2003 to 2007, where she earned a Bachelor's degree in Mechanical Engineering.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Budapest University of Technology and Economics\", \"National University of Kharkiv\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Budapest University of Technology and Economics\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"National University of Kharkiv\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
